    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "Я подумаю.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go back through the exchange around The Crashed Car line by line and unpack how the Russian works.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "Ну что, бампера нет...",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well, the bumper is gone...' Elena assesses the missing parts. She notes the front end is damaged.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "и фара разбита.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And the headlight is smashed.' She inspects the rest of the destruction. Elena sees the light is shattered.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "Я в порядке, не я была за рулем.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am fine. I was not driving.' She reassures him about her safety. Elena clarifies she was not the one involved in the crash.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "Это длинная история...",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It is a long story...' Elena avoids giving a full explanation. She waves it off as too complicated.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "потом расскажу, ладно?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I will tell you later, okay?' She promises to explain later. Elena asks for his patience.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "Все, давай, пока.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'All right, bye.' Elena hastily ends the conversation. She says a quick goodbye.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Да вы не переживайте, я все починю.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do not worry, I will fix everything.' Chef Barinov tries to calm her down. He promises to repair all the damage himself.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Просто хотел как лучше.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I was only trying to help.' He offers a weak defense for his actions. Barinov claims his intentions were good.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "Я представляю, что бы было...",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I can imagine what you would have done...' Elena sarcastically contemplates his 'help'. She wonders about his true capabilities.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "если бы вы захотели как хуже.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If you meant to make things worse.' She considers the alternative. Elena shudders to think what he would do if he meant harm.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "Вы вообще понимаете...",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you realize...' Elena checks if he understands the gravity of the situation. She demands his attention.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "что я могу написать заявление?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I could file a complaint?' She reminds him of her legal options. Elena threatens to make an official police report. Now let's listen to the whole conversation again from start to finish.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
